# Keys and certs — agnosai has NO legitimate .pem in the tree and never signs.
# It only ever VERIFIES, and the one keypair any test needs is baked into
# tests/server_auth_vectors.cyr as frozen RS256 vectors, deliberately (see that
# file's header). A .pem appearing here is therefore always debris or a mistake.
#
# Added 2026-08-10 after `probe_key_tmp.pem` — a live RSA PRIVATE KEY — was found
# committed at the repo root in bb76e67, referenced by nothing.
*.pem
*.key
